---
import ServiceSidebar from '@/components/services/ServiceSidebar.astro';
---

<section id="content" class="bg-white py-14 lg:py-18">
  <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-12">

      <!-- Main Content Column -->
      <main class="lg:col-span-8">
        <h2 class="text-[28px] lg:text-[36px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif mb-6 leading-[1.2]">
          Tax Help for Individuals in Utah
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[#374151] text-[16px] leading-[1.65] mb-8">
          We can help assist you with all of your personal tax needs, whether you're facing an IRS audit, you have unpaid IRS taxes, the IRS is levying your wages or garnishing your bank account, you need help with a settlement offer to the IRS, you need personal tax planning, or you have issues with state taxes. We have over 30 years of experience assisting individuals with all of these tax issues.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-[28px] lg:text-[36px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif mb-6 mt-12 leading-[1.2]">
          Individual Tax Services We Provide
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-5 mb-10">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 pb-4 border-b border-gray-200">
            <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-[#C1272D]/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-[#C1272D]">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-[18px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif mb-1">Audit Help for Individuals</h3>
              <p class="text-[#4B5563] text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The IRS can audit you by mail, in the IRS offices, in your office, or in your home.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 pb-4 border-b border-gray-200">
            <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-[#C1272D]/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-[#C1272D]">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 6l3 1m0 0l-3 9a5.002 5.002 0 006.001 0M6 7l3 9M6 7l6-2m6 2l3-1m-3 1l-3 9a5.002 5.002 0 006.001 0M18 7l3 9m-3-9l-6-2m0-2v2m0 16V5m0 16H9m3 0h3"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-[18px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif mb-1">Appealing an IRS Audit or Offer In Compromise Denial</h3>
              <p class="text-[#4B5563] text-[15px] leading-relaxed">In certain circumstances, you may have the right to appeal an IRS decision.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 pb-4 border-b border-gray-200">
            <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-[#C1272D]/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-[#C1272D]">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-[18px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif mb-1">Bank Levy / Wage Garnishment</h3>
              <p class="text-[#4B5563] text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The IRS can issue a bank levy to obtain your cash in savings and checking accounts.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 pb-4 border-b border-gray-200">
            <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-[#C1272D]/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-[#C1272D]">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-[18px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif mb-1">Tax Liens</h3>
              <p class="text-[#4B5563] text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The IRS may file a federal tax lien to protect its claim against your property.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 pb-4 border-b border-gray-200">
            <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-[#C1272D]/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-[#C1272D]">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-[18px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif mb-1">Tax Penalty Abatement</h3>
              <p class="text-[#4B5563] text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The most common penalties are Failure to File and Failure to Pay penalties.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 pb-4 border-b border-gray-200">
            <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-[#C1272D]/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-[#C1272D]">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-[18px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif mb-1">Innocent Spouse Relief</h3>
              <p class="text-[#4B5563] text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The IRS can collect against you as individuals and you and your spouse as a couple.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-[28px] lg:text-[36px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif mb-6 mt-12 leading-[1.2]">
          Why Choose Michelle Turpin P.C.?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[#374151] text-[16px] leading-[1.65] mb-4">
          Our attorneys are highly experienced and knowledgeable of all areas of tax law. They have dealt with nearly every kind of tax situation imaginable, and they will be able to help you navigate the complex world of tax law as you try to deal with the IRS and other agencies. With offices in Salt Lake City and St. George, we serve individuals throughout Utah and across the country.
        </p>
        <p class="text-[#374151] text-[16px] leading-[1.65] mb-8">
          <strong class="text-[#C1272D] font-bold">No one should have to deal with the IRS alone.</strong> Call us today at <strong class="text-[#C1272D] font-bold">(801) 685-0552</strong> to schedule your consultation.
        </p>

        <div class="border-t border-gray-200 mt-10 pt-6">
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 italic">This content is provided for informational purposes only and does not constitute legal advice.</p>
        </div>
      </main>

      <!-- Sidebar Column -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-4">
        <div class="sticky top-24">
          <ServiceSidebar currentPath="/services/individuals-tax-help" topicTitle="Individual Tax Help" />
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
